\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\fs24 \cf0 3. Penggunaan PHPMetric\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs20 \cf0 Basic Usage\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs18 \cf0 # Analisis direktori\
phpmetrics --report-html=metrics src/\
\
# Analisis dengan format JSON\
phpmetrics --report-json=metrics.json src/\
\
# Analisis dengan violations\
phpmetrics --violations src/\
\
# Custom rules\
phpmetrics --config=phpmetrics.json src/\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\fs20 \cf0 Output PHPMetric\
PHPMetric memberikan analisis mendalam:\
\'95 Maintainability Index: Indeks maintainability\
\'95 Technical Debt: Hutang teknis\
\'95 Cyclomatic Complexity: Kompleksitas per method\
\'95 Halstead Metrics: Volume, difficulty, effort\
\'95 Code Violations: Pelanggaran coding standards\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\fs20 \cf0 Contoh Output HTML Report\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs18 \cf0 \'95\'95\'95 index.html (Dashboard utama)\
\'95\'95\'95 violations.html (Code violations)\
\'95\'95\'95 complexity.html (Complexity analysis)\
\'95\'95\'95 maintainability.html (Maintainability index)\
\'95\'95\'95 barcharts.html (Charts dan graphs)\
\'95\'95\'95 assets/ (CSS, JS, images)\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\fs24 \cf0 4. Metodologi Functional Point Analysis\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs20 \cf0 Identifikasi Function Types\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs18 \cf0 External Input (EI)\
- Form submissions\
- File uploads\
- API POST/PUT requests\
- Data entry forms\
\
External Output (EO)\
- Reports\
- API responses\
- Email notifications\
- File downloads\
\
External Inquiry (EQ)\
- Search forms\
- API GET requests\
- Data queries\
- Status checks\
\
Internal Logical Files (ILF)\
- Database tables\
- Configuration files\
- Cache storage\
- Session data\
\
External Interface Files (EIF)\
- External APIs\
- Third-party services\
- File imports\
- Data feeds\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\fs20 \cf0 Complexity Assessment\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs18 \cf0 Data Element Types (DET)\
- Input fields\
- Output fields\
- Database columns\
- API parameters\
\
File Type Referenced (FTR)\
- Number of files/tables referenced\
- External systems accessed\
\
Complexity Matrix\
Low Complexity:    DET: 1-4,   FTR: 0-1\
Average Complexity: DET: 5-15, FTR: 2-3\
High Complexity:    DET: 16+,  FTR: 4+\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\fs20 \cf0 Function Point Calculation\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs18 \cf0 Unadjusted Function Points (UFP)\
UFP = \'8e(EI \'d7 Weight) + \'8e(EO \'d7 Weight) + \'8e(EQ \'d7 Weight) + \'8e(ILF \'d7 Weight) + \'8e(EIF \'d7 Weight)\
\
Weights by Complexity\
| Type | Low | Average | High |\
|------|-----|---------|------|\
| EI   | 3   | 4       | 6    |\
| EO   | 4   | 5       | 7    |\
| EQ   | 3   | 4       | 6    |\
| ILF  | 7   | 10      | 15   |\
| EIF  | 5   | 7       | 10   |\
\
Value Adjustment Factor (VAF)\
VAF = 0.65 + (0.01 \'d7 Degree of Influence)\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\fs20 \cf0 Productivity Metrics\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs18 \cf0 Lines of Code per Function Point\
- Assembly: 320 LOC/FP\
- C: 150 LOC/FP\
- Java: 55 LOC/FP\
- PHP: 50-65 LOC/FP\
- Python: 40-50 LOC/FP\
\
Effort Estimation\
Effort (person-months) = AFP \'f7 Productivity Rate\
Productivity Rate \'eb 8-12 FP per person-month\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\fs24 \cf0 5. Contoh Analisis untuk PHP Project\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs20 \cf0 E-commerce Website\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs18 \cf0 # Analisis kode\
phploc app/\
phpmetrics --report-html=metrics app/\
\
# Function Point Count\
EI: User registration (4 FP), Product search (3 FP), Add to cart (4 FP)\
EO: Order confirmation (5 FP), Invoice (7 FP)\
EQ: Product catalog (4 FP), Order status (3 FP)\
ILF: Users table (10 FP), Products table (10 FP), Orders table (10 FP)\
EIF: Payment gateway (7 FP), Shipping API (5 FP)\
\
Total UFP: 82 FP\
VAF: 1.05 (DI = 40)\
AFP: 86 FP\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\fs20 \cf0 Content Management System\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs18 \cf0 # Analisis kode\
phploc src/\
phpmetrics --report-html=metrics src/\
\
# Function Point Count\
EI: Create post (4 FP), Upload media (4 FP)\
EO: RSS feed (5 FP), Sitemap (4 FP)\
EQ: Search content (3 FP), Category filter (3 FP)\
ILF: Posts table (10 FP), Users table (10 FP), Media table (7 FP)\
EIF: Social media APIs (7 FP), Analytics (5 FP)\
\
Total UFP: 75 FP\
VAF: 0.95 (DI = 30)\
AFP: 71 FP\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\fs24 \cf0 6. Best Practices\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs20 \cf0 Regular Analysis\
- Jalankan analisis setiap sprint/release\
- Track metrics over time\
- Identify improvement areas\
\
Quality Gates\
- Set thresholds untuk complexity\
- Monitor maintainability index\
- Review code violations\
\
Integration dengan CI/CD\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs18 \cf0 # .github/workflows/analysis.yml\
name: Code Analysis\
on: [push, pull_request]\
jobs:\
  analysis:\
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\
    steps:\
      - uses: actions/checkout@v2\
      - name: Setup PHP\
        uses: shivammathur/setup-php@v2\
        with:\
          php-version: '8.1'\
      - name: Install dependencies\
        run: composer install\
      - name: Run PHPLoc\
        run: phploc src/ --log-json=phploc.json\
      - name: Run PHPMetric\
        run: phpmetrics --report-html=metrics src/\
      - name: Upload artifacts\
        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v2\
        with:\
          name: code-metrics\
          path: |\
            phploc.json\
            metrics/\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\fs20 \cf0 Custom Rules\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs18 \cf0 // phpmetrics.json\
\{\
  "rules": \{\
    "cyclomaticComplexity": \{\
      "max": 10\
    \},\
    "maintainabilityIndex": \{\
      "min": 50\
    \},\
    "halsteadVolume": \{\
      "max": 1000\
    \}\
  \}\
\}\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\fs24 \cf0 7. Kesimpulan\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs18 \cf0 Functional Point Analysis dengan PHPLoc dan PHPMetric memberikan:\
\'95 Objective measurement ukuran fungsional aplikasi\
\'95 Quality metrics untuk maintainability dan complexity\
\'95 Productivity tracking untuk estimasi effort\
\'95 Technical debt identification untuk improvement planning\
\
Dengan tools ini, development teams dapat membuat keputusan yang lebih informed tentang project planning, resource allocation, dan quality improvement initiatives.\
\
---\
*Panduan untuk analisis Functional Point Analysis pada project PHP*\
}